---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile, awards } from '../data/credits';
---
<Layout
  title="About Gary Lucy | Biography — Preview"
  description="Preview: Rolling Stone-style layout for the About page."
  path="/about-rs-preview"
>
  <article class="rs-page" data-theme="crimson">
    <header class="rs-hero">
      <img src="/hero/gl-standing-bw-web.jpg" alt="Gary Lucy" class="rs-hero-img" />
      <div class="rs-hero-scrim"></div>
      <div class="rs-hero-content">
        <p class="rs-kicker">Rolling Stone Style — Preview</p>
        <h1 class="rs-headline">Gary Lucy Is Still Writing<br />His Own Third Act</h1>
        <p class="rs-dek">
          Three decades after Hollyoaks made him a household name, the actor talks
          soap villains, stage fright, and why The Good Ship Murder feels like a
          second wind.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="rs-body">
      <div class="rs-byline">By The Editors &middot; {new Date().getFullYear()}</div>

      <p class="rs-lede">{profile.bioShort}</p>

      <p>
        Lucy began his career as a child actor in <em>Grange Hill</em> and
        <em>Dream Team</em> before landing the role that made his name: Luke Morgan
        in Channel 4's <em>Hollyoaks</em>, a performance that won him Best Newcomer
        at the 2000 British Soap Awards. He went on to lead roles in
        <em>Footballers' Wives</em>, <em>The Bill</em> and <em>EastEnders</em>,
        building one of the most recognisable careers in British popular drama.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="rs-pullquote">
        &ldquo;I've never chased the safe option. The parts that scare me a
        little are usually the ones worth doing.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        Lucy made his stage debut leading the UK touring production of
        <em>The Full Monty</em> as Gaz, and most recently returned to primetime
        crime drama as Jason Agnew in Channel 5's <em>The Good Ship Murder</em>.
      </p>

      <div class="rs-divider"></div>

      <h2 class="rs-section-title">Recognition</h2>
      <ul class="rs-awards">
        {awards.map((a) => (
          <li>
            <span class="rs-award-name">{a.category}</span>
            <span class="rs-award-meta">{a.name} &middot; {a.year} &middot; {a.result}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .rs-page {
    --rs-red: #a32638;
    --rs-ink: #111;
    --rs-paper: #f7f5f0;
    background: var(--rs-paper);
    color: var(--rs-ink);
  }

  .rs-hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 92vh;
    min-height: 560px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }
  .rs-hero-img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 15%;
    filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.12);
  }
  .rs-hero-scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.05) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,.85) 100%);
  }
  .rs-hero-content {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    padding: 0 clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 4rem) clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    max-width: 980px;
  }
  .rs-kicker {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 1.1vw, 0.8rem);
    color: var(--rs-red);
    margin: 0 0 0.6em;
  }
  .rs-headline {
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 0.4em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .rs-dek {
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    color: #eee;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .rs-body {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 1.5rem clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }
  .rs-byline {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #777;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--rs-ink);
    padding-bottom: 0.75em;
    margin-bottom: 1.75em;
  }
  .rs-lede {
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .rs-body p {
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #222;
  }
  .rs-body em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .rs-pullquote {
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--rs-red);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--rs-red);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rs-red);
    padding: 0.9em 0;
    margin: 2em 0;
  }
  .rs-divider {
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--rs-ink);
    margin: 2.5em 0 1.75em;
  }
  .rs-section-title {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 1em;
  }
  .rs-awards {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .rs-awards li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85em 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .rs-award-name {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .rs-award-meta {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .rs-awards li { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2em; }
    .rs-award-meta { text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
